        <mxCell id="moxp4zKkcIowtqQu5v4O-185" value="&lt;h2 style=&quot;font-weight: 500; font-size: 22.86px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 18.288px 0px 13.716px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Oxygen, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;K-средних (K-Means)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ds-markdown-paragraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 13.716px 0px; font-size: 16.002px; line-height: 28.575px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Oxygen, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Когда использовать:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 13.716px 0px; padding-left: 27.432px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Oxygen, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16.002px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ds-markdown-paragraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16.002px; line-height: 28.575px;&quot;&gt;Данные имеют сферическую или выпуклую форму кластеров.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ds-markdown-paragraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16.002px; line-height: 28.575px;&quot;&gt;Нужен быстрый и простой метод.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ds-markdown-paragraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16.002px; line-height: 28.575px;&quot;&gt;Заранее известно примерное число кластеров (&lt;code style=&quot;font-size: 0.875em; font-weight: 500; font-family: Menlo, &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, Courier, monospace, Inter, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.15rem 0.3rem;&quot;&gt;k&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ds-markdown-paragraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 13.716px 0px; font-size: 16.002px; line-height: 28.575px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Oxygen, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;П&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;люсы:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Простота и скорость работы даже на больших данных.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Хорошо масштабируется.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ds-markdown-paragraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 13.716px 0px; font-size: 16.002px; line-height: 28.575px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Oxygen, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Минусы:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Чувствителен к выбросам.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Плохо работает с кластерами сложной формы.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
